  speakerName: Elder Othelia
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: Before the curse, the Petrified King ruled these lands justly. But
    he sought immortality from the deep crags... and his heart turned to stone. Shadows
    consumed the fortress from within.
  options:
  - optionText: A tragic fate. I can search for the signet ring on your behalf.
    requiresCheck: 0
